Import the SAML IdP only when it is used

keystone.api.auth loaded pysaml2 through keystone.federation.idp,
though only the SAML and ECP assertion endpoints use it. Import it where
the generators are built. In the probe, keystone's anonymous RSS falls
from 95MB to 81MB and 55 saml2 modules are no longer loaded.

Add a test that importing the server application does not load saml2.

Prompt: Mikal asked for privsep memory fixes that can be landed one at a
time and measured in devstack CI; keystone is one of the larger services.

